.PP
Use the default raid strings inquiry table to seed
a user-defined table.
.Cs
rock # cvlabel -R > /Library/Preferences/Xsan/raid-strings
.Ce
.SH NOTES
.PP
Some operating systems require a reboot after a disk is labeled or relabeled. It is recommended that Xsan nodes are rebooted after new labels are written or existing labels are updated.
